  "notes": ["Only the initial B is retained in the coordinator stream. Each second B is injected into a separate copy at the processed-pad boundary. The original stage inlet is initialized and empty.","The two accepted area contacts write reaction class 10 and the secondary-rate multiplier on visit 185. The actual secondary rate changes on 186, independently of the zero pose timer, unit primary rate, and four-visit impact gates.","The world can publish a second paid type-41 parent on the area-hit visit or on the following visit. The existing area can hit the newly published parent, which has 1 HP and does not add actor credit.","Only one tested schedule and timing joins both sources against Sasuke on the same visit. Amount-entry samples show the new parent uses tier 0 and the old area uses tier 1; they retain distinct tokens.","No floor construction, stage reach, general recipient order, guard policy, audio or drawing, or native gameplay is qualified."],
